OL,3,GNEWSAEx-mayor posted antisemitic
OL,4,Atweets, jury finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former North Yorkshire councillor who
OL,7,Falso served as the mayor of Harrogate
OL,8,Fposted antisemitic tweets which were
OL,9,Flikely to stir up racial hatred, a jury
OL,10,Fhas found.
OL,12,FPat Marsh, 78, who has dementia, faced
OL,13,Fa trial of facts at York Crown Court as
OL,14,Fshe was deemed physically and mentally
OL,15,Funfit to enter a plea and give
OL,16,Fevidence.
OL,18,FA jury concluded on Friday that Marsh
OL,19,Fwas likely to have stirred up hatred by
OL,20,Fpublishing written material in relation
OL,21,Fto posts made on X in January and
OL,22,FFebruary 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
